{"ref":"BDB, פְּנִימִי","hw":"פְּנִימִי","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנִימִי</span></big><sub>32</sub>  <strong>adj. inner</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.27\">1 K 6:27</a> +; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנִימִית</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.36\">36</a> +; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנִימִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.11\">1 Ch 28:11</a>; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנִימִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.22\">2 Ch 4:22</a>;—always c. art., and always of parts of building, usually temple: <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.27\">1 K 6:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.12\">7:12</a> +; especially <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.3\">Ez 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.3\">10:3</a> + 21 times <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40-46\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40-46\">40–46</a>; as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּפְּנִימִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.17\">41:17</a> <em>on the inside</em> (but dub., v. Co al.); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־הַפְּנִימִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.4\">42:4</a> <em>toward the inside</em> (del. 𝔊 𝔖 Co Toy al.)","next":"BDB, לִפְנָ֑י²","prev":"BDB, פְּנִ֫ימָה"}